    // Summit
    "Extra.Harvey.Summit": "When I'm next to you, I'm not even scared of falling off this cliff and dashing onto the sharp rocks below...$l\"/jump Harvey/shake Harvey 1000/pause 1000/speak Harvey \"...$8#$b#I... I love and admire you very much, @...$l\"",

