    // SPRING
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Spring.EarlyHeart.1": "Y'know, even with the clinic drowning in debt, I'm glad I have time to relax.$h#$b#It's nice having an opportunity to enjoy a small town, the people, and especially the views...",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Spring.EarlyHeart.2": "Ugh, I wish I could just stand out in the open fields all day.$s#$b#All the blooming flowers and weeds make such good medicine.$h#$b#Speaking of, you wouldn't happen to have any taraxacum officinale—Err, dandelions on you, would you?#$b#Their roots are a great liver tonic and make for a good coffee substitute.$h",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Spring.EarlyHeart.3": "Oh, you're looking rather flush today, I assume from your work?#$b#...#$b#No?$a#$b#Well, you might want to schedule an appointment to get that checked out, @. That's not normal.$a",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Spring.EarlyHeart.4": "Have you decided on a date for your yearly appointment yet?#$b#I'd really like to get you scheduled in for that checkup we discussed when you first came down...#$b#...$a#$b#Tch.$a#$b#It looks like that mark is getting worse, @.$s#$b#Seriously, schedule an appointment soon.$a",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Spring.EarlyHeart.5": "You should really be careful on that farm, {{LPetName}}.$s#$b#I wouldn't want you to overwork yourself and end up in one of my beds.$s#$e#...What?$a#$b#'{{PetName}}'?$a#$b#Oh, @. If you're having trouble hearing, you should book an appointment with the clinic.$s",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Spring.EarlyHeart.6": "%Harvey bumps into you, his face immediately turning to one with regret.#$b#Oh, my Yoba, so sorry about that, @!$8#$b#Oh, you have a bruise there...$8#$b#Was that because of me?$8#$b#Or because of your farmwork?$a#$b#Well, no matter...$h#$b#Here, take some of this with food and that should go away quickly...[351]",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Spring.EarlyHeart.7": "%You overhear Harvey mumbling a few names of medications to himself.#$b#Hm?#$b#Oh, sorry, I'm just listing all of my patient's medications again so I don't forget.$h#$b#Say, you aren't taking any outside of the ones I've approved of, are you?$a",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Spring.EarlyHeart.8": "...$l#$e#Hm? I was staring?$8#$b#Oh, no, @. I was checking on that mark on your neck.$h#$b#You've still yet to make an appointment for that, by the way.$a",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Spring.EarlyHeart.9": "Oh, hey.$h#$b#I was looking over some of the medical records your last doctor sent over",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Spring.EarlyHeart.10": "%Harvey yawns, his age peeking through as you notice the bags under his eyes.#$b#Sorry, I was up all last night taking inventory of our medicine reserves.$s#$b#Did you need something?",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Spring.EarlyHeart.11": "Make sure you wear something warm while you're outside.#$b#I know summer's right around the corner, but it's still flu season!$a#$b#I wouldn't want you getting sick so early in the year, yeah?$h",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Spring.EarlyHeart.12": "Is the pollen here bothering you at all?#$b#Sam's allergies hit him like a truck every year, and with you being new and all, I just wouldn't be surprised if you got a bit...$s#$b#Well, if you need any benadryl, just let me know, yeah?$h",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Spring.EarlyHeart.13": "Ah~ Springtime's always my favorite, means there's always an excuse to stand outside and breathe fresh air.$h#$b#That, and obviously I notice a few of my patients' moods improve drastically this time of year.#$b#It really is a miracle season.$h",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Spring.EarlyHeart.14": "Today's weather seems absolutely perfect for a plane right, doesn't it?$h#$b#Speaking of, have you ever considered getting an AT-502 for your farm?#$b#I bet it'd make pest control a hell of a lot easier.$h",

    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Spring.MidHeart.1": "Oh, hey.$h#$b#I was looking over some of the medical records your last doctor sent over.#$b#Looks like you're chronically vitamin me deficient.$l#$b#Sorry, too cheesy?$h",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Spring.MidHeart.2": "Remember to get plenty of rest, yeah?#$b#I know it's not easy managing both a disease and a farm, but...$s",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Spring.MidHeart.3": "This heat is killer, isn't it?$s#$b#How are you doing? Is the disease flaring up with the heat?#$b#Oh, it can't be easy doing all that farmwork in your condition...$s#$b#You should take a break, {{LPetName}}.#$b#Here, why don't I go and pour you a glass of water, hm?$h",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Spring.MidHeart.4": "I know it's only spring, but make sure you're wearing sunscreen when you go out, yeah?#$b#UV rays hit no matter the season and I wouldn't want you in more discomfort with your...$s#$b#Err—circumstances.$s",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Spring.MidHeart.5": "Oh, {{LPetName}}!$h#$b#There you are, I was just wondering when you'd show up.$h#$b#Here, I got something to make you feel better.[591 597]$l",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Spring.MidHeart.6": "Y'know, you've really been putting me in a pickle with some of these thoughts I've been having about you, @.[342]$h#$b#No, seriously. I might have to talk to the medical board about you soon...$s",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Spring.MidHeart.7": "Oh, {{LPetName}}... I have some bad news...$s#$b#The more I'm reading about it, the more I'm worried your disease might be contagious.$s#$b#Maybe you should stay away from others for now...#$b#Err—$8#$b#Not me though!$8#$b#You still need someone to continuously monitor you...$l",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Spring.MidHeart.8": "%Harvey nearly drops the clipboard he's holding when you tap on his shoulder.#$b#O-Oh! {{PetName}}, sorry, I didn't see you there.$8#$b#D-Did you, uh...$s#$b#%Harvey slowly puts the clipboard behind him, out of view. You manage to catch a few scribbles of something referring to your condition...#$b#Did you need something today?$s",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Spring.MidHeart.9": "Oh, before I forget!$h#$b#I meant to show you a few diagrams of proper lifting techniques...#$b#I know you're alone often on that massive farm of yours and the last thing I want is for you to hurt yourself when no one else is around...$s",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Spring.MidHeart.10": "When your grandpa was still alive, I'd sit with him at his appointments just chatting sometimes...#$b#Back then, there was another doctor who worked here that I shadowed, but...$s#$b#Yeah, anyways, your grandpa would go on and on about how proud he was of you.$h#$b#I'd never imagined how much better you are in person.$l",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Spring.MidHeart.11": "Y'know, I've never really had a patient with such a rare blood type.#$b#I guess you're special in more ways than one, huh?$h#$b#Hm? Oh, don't worry.#$b#I'm probably the only one in town able to give blood if necessary.$l",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Spring.MidHeart.12": "Hey, I never got any records on your last dental checkup when you moved down.#$b#I mean, I'm not too big on the dental aspect of health...$s#$b#But, if you need me to look around that mouth, I'm more than happy to shove a few of my tools in there...$l",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Spring.MidHeart.13": "$y 'Have you still been prying around in the mines?_Yes._Are you kidding?! Last time you passed out you got that disease! How can you be this careless..._No._You aren't lying to me, right? You know it's dangerous down there, given your disease and all...$s'",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Spring.MidHeart.14": "It's been a while since your last checkup.#$b#I could fit you in now, if you'd like.#$b#Say 'Ahhh', {{LPetName}}.$l",

    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Spring.LateHeart.1": "Why are you in town? Your disease—$a#$b#Here, let me do all the shopping for you, {{LPetName}}.#$b#You go back to the farm and rest, yeah?$h",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Spring.LateHeart.2": "I've noticed all of the work you've been doing on your farm lately, but...$s#$b#Do you ever listen to me?$s#$b#You should really be taking this disease more seriously.$a#$b#You could get hurt if you overexert yourself.$a",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Spring.LateHeart.3": "...$l#$b#Sorry, I just can't help but to stare when the scenery's so {{LDescript}}...$l#$b#You don't have anywhere else to go, right? You can just stay here all day with me, right?$l",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Spring.LateHeart.4": "Mmmmm...#$b#You look paler than usual.$a#$b#You weren't in the mines again, were you?$a",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Spring.LateHeart.5": "%Harvey's lost in thought, mumbling to himself about medications and their interactions.#$b#Hm? Oh.#$b#...$l#$b#Sorry, I didn't really expect to see you today, {{LPetName}}.$l#$b#How are you?$l#$b#You're not working too hard, right?$l#$b#I might have to drag you to one of our empty beds if you are.$l",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Spring.LateHeart.6": "...$s#$b#You don't think I'm...$s#$b#Controlling, do you?$s#$b#I just...$s#$b#I just care about your health is all, {{LPetName}}.$s#$b#I know what's best for you.$l",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Spring.LateHeart.7": "%Harvey notices a petal in your hair, picking it out.#$b#How fitting, hm?$l#$b#Even while you're here chatting with me, you still need me to take care of you.$l#$b#What'd you come by for, anyway?",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Spring.LateHeart.8": "Oh, hold on.$a#$b#%Harvey takes your wrist, checking your pulse.#$b#Your heartbeat is running a little high, are you sure you should be running around in your condition?$a#$b#You could seriously hurt yourself, {{LPetName}}!$a#$b#Here, come sit on one of the chairs in the waiting room to calm yourself down.",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Spring.LateHeart.9": "Here, I thought you should eat something other than the random things you forage.#$b#Someone in your condition needs to eat hearty![237]$h",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Spring.LateHeart.10": "%Harvey takes out a small hankerchief, wiping some sweat around from your brow, and pocketing the fabric before smiling.#$b#Please make sure you're taking care of yourself, {{LPetName}}.$h#$b#I wouldn't want you to end up on my examination table before your next appointment.$l",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Spring.LateHeart.11": "Did you know chocolates are considered to be an aphrodisiac?#$b#It contains small amounts of substances that boost pleasure and reduce stress, including phenylethylamine, tryptophan, and theobromine.#$b#While it's not the most healthy of gifts, I just had to get you some, my dear.[220]$l",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Spring.LateHeart.12": "You're glowing today, {{LPetName}}.$l#$b#I think our treatments for your illness may finally be helping, but don't put any unecessary strain on yourself!#$b#Doctor's orders.",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Spring.LateHeart.13": "...$s#$b#Sorry, it's just been lonely night after lonely night at the clinic lately.$s#$b#You should keep me company sometime.#$b#Even doctors need some TLC.$l",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Spring.LateHeart.14": "$y 'I saw you exit the mines earlier, you didn't get hurt, right?_No..._Liar. Look at your arm! Do I need to remind you of what you promised me about you getting hurt like this?$a_Well..._Come into the clinic, let me patch you up properly.$a'",

    // SUMMER
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Summer.EarlyHeart.1": "I know summer is a busy time on the farm, but do be sure to take care of yourself, yeah?#$b#You're always welcome in my clinic for a rest and something to drink if need be.",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Summer.EarlyHeart.2": "...$7#$b#Sorry, I just don't think I've ever seen you in anything but your normal getup.$7#$b#Do you always wear less clothes during summer?",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Summer.EarlyHeart.3": "It's always important to regulate your body temperature properly through these heatwaves.#$b#Say, are you free later?#$b#We could always go cool down by the beach if you're interested.$h#$b#Err, as a doctor wanting the best for his patient, of course.$8",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Summer.EarlyHeart.4": "Y'know, the key to lowering your chances of developing melanoma are sunscreen and thin layers of clothing, especially since you're outside most of the day.#$b#Speaking of, do you ever take a break?$a#$b#You can always stop by the clinic for some AC and electrolytes if needed.",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Summer.EarlyHeart.5": "Oh, @!$h#$b#Err, I was looking through your files earlier and I hope you don't mind that I...$s#$b#Well, I adjusted them a little bit.#$b#Just some doctor jargon, nothing to worry about.$h#$b#Promise.$l",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Summer.EarlyHeart.6": "I know it gets hot down here in the valley, but make sure you're keeping your windows closed at night, yeah?#$b#Why?$a#$b#Contrary to popular belief, @, drafts, especially when you're sleeping, can be deterimental to your health!$a#$b#Just trust me...$s",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Summer.EarlyHeart.7": "Oh, I thought you'd show up today!$h#$b#Here, I made extra just for you.[253]",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Summer.EarlyHeart.8": "Your face is so red and flushed. Hold on, let me check your heart rate.$a#$b#...#$b#Hmm...$a#$b#You aren't overexerting yourself, are you?$a#$b#You know people die every day due to not taking proper precautions during summer.$s#$b#Here, this should help you cool down.[873]",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Summer.EarlyHeart.9": "It's awfully hot today, isn't it?$h#$b#Make sure you're wearing enough sunscreen.#$b#I wouldn't want that beautiful skin to—$l#$b#Err, I mean, I just wouldn't want you to get a sunburn is all!$7",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Summer.EarlyHeart.10": "Here, I thought you might like one of these.#$b#I found it over by the playground and thought it'd look good in your ha—[402]$l#$b#Err... Sorry, just—$7#$b#Ah, traditionally, lathyrus odoratus—err, sweet peas— were used for wound dressings and for their anti-inflamatory benefits.#$b#I just thought it might help you stay a little safer when you're down in the mines. Albiet against medical advice, but...$h",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Summer.EarlyHeart.11": "Oh, hey!$h#$b#I've been meaning to ask you: do you think I could get a spare key for your house?#$b#It'll just be for medical emergies.$h#$b#Don't worry, I have them for all my patients.#$b#I just really wouldn't want something to happen to you and you be all alone...$s",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Summer.EarlyHeart.12": "I've been doing some reading into electroconvulsive therapy. Interesting stuff, I might say...#$b#Though, some patients have been known to become more docile and suffer memory losses...$s#$b#Hm? What is electroconvulsive therapy?#$b#Oh, shock therapy.$h#$b#Why? Interested in a few sessions?#$b#Hm, I guess it might help with the depression you may face being alone all the time on that farm...$s",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Summer.EarlyHeart.13": "Oh, hold still.$a#$b#%Harvey lifts your chin, inspecting your jaw and neck. He plucks a leaf from inside the collar of your shirt out.#$b#Sorry, just needed to make sure everything's fine.#$b#Many things can be missed, y'know?$h",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Summer.EarlyHeart.14": "Have you been up to the bathhouse yet?#$b#It might help some of those aches and pains you get from doing all that farmwork.",

    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Summer.MidHeart.1": "I've been interested in learning more about the psychology aspect of medicine, but...#$b#Ugh, the library here really isn't the best for that.$s#$b#Maybe I should pay a visit the Zuzu city soon...",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Summer.MidHeart.2": "Have you ever heard of the milgram experiment?#$b#Well, to cut things short, it essentially tested the willingness of participants to obey an authority figure despite conflicts with their conscience.#$b#...#$b#Do you think you'd follow someone, despite the heinous things they might ask you to do, {{LPetName}}?$l",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Summer.MidHeart.3": "U was diubg sine readubg tge itger dat abd stynbked yoib a few books about the 'dancing plague'.#$b#Apparently contemporaries blamed 'divine punishment' or 'hot blood' for the mass hysteria that happened in 1518.#$b#While the doctor part of me wants to blame potential ergot poisoning and just plain religious fears...$s#$b#I can't help but admire how divine punishment can show itself in mysterious ways, don't you agree?",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Summer.MidHeart.4": "How are you faring lately? You aren't over exerting yourself, are you?#$b#I worry about you, dealing with that illness and doing all that hard farmwork when the heat is bearing down...$s",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Summer.MidHeart.5": "We should have a safeword when you call me, so I know when you're okay versus when you need help.#$b#You know I'd be there in a heartbeat to take care of you, {{LPetName}}.$l#$b#Err, as your doctor that is.$h",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Summer.MidHeart.6": "Ugh, all this heat is making me sweat up a storm.$s#$b#I don't know how others can maintain facial hair, it all just... accumulates.$s#$b#Do you think I should shave it? Maybe it's time for something new...",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Summer.MidHeart.7": "...#$b#...$a#$b#Have you been running around this entire time without sunscreen? You look red.$a#$b#Ugh, come on. I'll take you to an exam room to help you apply some since you clearly can't do it on your own.$a",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Summer.MidHeart.8": "Oh, how lovely! I didn't think I'd get a chance to see you today!$h#$b#Well, since you're here, I think I could fit you in for a little checkup.#$b#How are you feeling with your disease and all?#$b#Is the heat having any effect on you at all?",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Summer.MidHeart.9": "Ah, @. I was just coming to warn you about how long exposure to the sun can typically cause dizziness in patients with your disorder.#$b#If you ever need to lay down, you're more than welcome to in my be—$l#$b#Err, the clinic!$7#$b#Just let Mari know I let you.$h",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Summer.MidHeart.10": "Just because it's summer doesn't mean you can't get sick, you know.#$b#I've seen some of the stuff you do on that farm, {{LPetName}}.$a#$b#You should really wash your hands more often, given your condition and all.$s",   
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Summer.MidHeart.11": "Yoba, this heat is absolutely killing me.$s#$b#I could really use an iced coffee right about now.$s#$b#Ah~ Would that be nice? Having a coffee shop here in the valley?$h",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Summer.MidHeart.12": "I know I should be grateful for the overall lack of illness in summer, but I can't help but worry for some of my patients.$s#$b#I'm sure this one patient's knees are absolutely killing him right about now.$s#$b#Speaking of, are you growing any peppers?#$b#I'm sure they'd help out a villager or two with their natural pain-relief properties.$h",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Summer.MidHeart.13": "Do you have a radio on that farm yet, {{LPetName}}?#$b#You should really look into getting one.#$b#I swear, summer skies are the best kind to listen in to, especially for planes. There's no interference from any clouds.$h",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Summer.MidHeart.14": "Have you seen any fireflies out yet? They love to come out during cooler summer nights.#$b#I guess I should show you my favorite spot someday, yeah?#$b#It could be a date!$h#$b#Err... Or just a casual meeting between a doctor and their patient...$s",

    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Summer.LateHeart.1": "You shouldn't be out in the sun for too long, {{LPetName}}.$a#$b#I know you wanted to see me, but it's not worth risking your health for that.$s",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Summer.LateHeart.2": "I heard these were great aphrodisiacs.#$b#Maybe we can test that theory at your next appointment, yeah?[421]$l",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Summer.LateHeart.3": "Y'know, next time you decide to be a brat at your checkup, I'll pull out the medical-grade restraints.$a#$b#There was no reason to stick your tongue out and lick me like that...$s",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Summer.LateHeart.4": "I know it's hot out, but you should really cover up. Thin layers are the key to preventing heat stroke out here.$a#$b#Plus, it's not only the sun's gaze you have to be weary of...$s",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Summer.LateHeart.5": "%You overhear Harvey mumbling about new pieces of MRI and CT technology that he can't quite afford.#$b#Oh, @. Sorry, I was just mumbling to myself how city doctors always get all this new, less-invasive and 'safe' procedural tech, but...$s#$b#I don't know, there's just something about doing things the old-fashioned way, right, {{LPetName}}?$h",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Summer.LateHeart.6": "$y 'Have you been taking your medicine lately, @?_Yes._Good {{LGoodName}}. Keep it up and I might reward you at our next appointment.$l_...Maybe_Don't lie to me, {{LPetName}}. I'll shove the pills down your throat if need be.$a'",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Summer.LateHeart.7": "You look flushed in this heat. Do you want me to escort you home?$s#$b#I could conduct a quick exam if you need...$l",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Summer.LateHeart.8": "I can't believe it's almost been half a year already. How does the saying go?$h#$b#I guess time really does fly when you're with the ones you love?$l",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Summer.LateHeart.9": "Has anyone ever told you you're just like summer, {{LPetName}}?$l#$b#Warm and bright, yet fleeting.$l#$b#Let me cherish these moments with you, yeah? I'm not getting any younger...$l",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Summer.LateHeart.10": "Even though it gets pretty hot here during summer, visiting the bathhouse every once in a while is still good for your health.#$b#Something about the benefits of saunas have caused even some patients of mine to miraculously regain some lost mobility in their extremeties.#$b#If you'd like, I could go with you.#$b#I could use some pain relief myself.$l",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Summer.LateHeart.11": "Have you been harvesting honey with all the flowers you're growing?#$b#I'm sure Vincent would like some. It's my secret to getting him to take cough medicine whenever he comes in with a cold.$h",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Summer.LateHeart.12": "...$l#$b#Hm? Oh, my cheeks are red?$7#$b#Sorry, it must be the summer heat making me feel a little woozy.$l",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Summer.LateHeart.13": "Seeing you run around town makes me remember my college days.#$b#I had so much energy back then, I honestly miss having knees that didn't ache all the time.$h#$b#I don't miss it for the life of me though, it wasn't until I was older that I got to meet you, after all.$l",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Summer.LateHeart.14": "Mmm... Hold on, you don't look too well.$a#$b#Say 'ahh' for me, {{LPetName}}. I need to make sure you don't have heatstroke...$a#$b#Or something worse.$s#$b#...#$b#...$a#$b#You look fine, for now. Take it easy or I'll force you to relax in the clinic.$a",

    // FALL
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Fall.EarlyHeart.1": "Hey, don't forget flu season's starting soon.#$b#Make sure you swing by and get yourself a flu shot, yeah?",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Fall.EarlyHeart.2": "Ugh, fall being around makes me remember all the times Alex came to me with a concussion after his gridball practices.#$b#I'm so glad he stopped, but between you and me, the business was nice...$s",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Fall.EarlyHeart.3": "Brrr... It's always so chilly this time of year. Make sure you cover up.#$b#Though I'm finding myself enjoying your company more and more, there's nothing more that I hate than seeing people sick or injured.",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Fall.EarlyHeart.4": "I can't believe how quickly the seasons have been changing this year.#$b#It's already fall and I've yet to really get to know you.$s#$b#Say, why don't we get a drink at Gus' sometime? We can err...#$b#Discuss your medical record or something...$l",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Fall.EarlyHeart.5": "Hmm... Hold out your hands for me.$a#$b#%Harvey runs his hands along your calloused hands, months of farmwork truly showing for the first time.#$b#...$a#$b#As I thought. Make sure you're taking care of these. It can get worse.$a",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Fall.EarlyHeart.6": "Fall's probably the busiest season for you, yeah?#$b#Well, if you ever need extra energy tonics, I'd be happy to write a personalized prescription for you.$h",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Fall.EarlyHeart.7": "Ugh, I tried changing my morning routine and adding some pumpkin spice to go along with the seasonal trends but...$s#$b#...Ugh.$s#$b#I think I'll just stick to my normal cup of plain coffee...$s",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Fall.EarlyHeart.8": "Y'know, I keep seeing you run around without a jacket. As a doctor, I have to advise against that.$a#$b#Here, you could have mine for now, but seriously, bundle up more. Doctor's orders.[(S)1018]",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Fall.EarlyHeart.9": "I know you're the type to forage a lot, so be careful while you're out there, yeah?#$b#While fall is the time for a lot of mushrooms, there's been many cases of people mistaking the good ones from the bad ones.$s",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Fall.EarlyHeart.10": "In a pinch, blackberry leaves can be used as a gargle for mouth and throat inflamation.#$b#But... Don't get any ideas, please. Due to the high levels of tannins, it can cause nausea and vomiting.$s#$b#If you have a cold or just a sore throat, you should always stop by the clinic. The stuff I have in here works a hell of a lot better.$h",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Fall.EarlyHeart.11": "Say, have you found any hazelnut lately? It makes a wonderful addition to coffee when roasted.#$b#I'll have to brew you some whenever I get my hands on it, the flavor's to die for.$h",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Fall.EarlyHeart.12": "That'll be the last time I try one of their 'new and better fall flavors!'$s#$b#I'm so tired of falling for all the same gimicks these coffee companies run on their products.$a#$b#It tasted like dirt. Such a shame to put good coffee beans to waste like that...$s",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Fall.EarlyHeart.13": "Make sure you're keeping your windows closed and locked at night. With this type of weather, I fear the slightest breeze could trigger a cold.$s#$b#Though I'd love the business, I'd hate to see someone as {{LDescript}} as you sick.$h",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Fall.EarlyHeart.14": "%You overhear Harvey mumbling something about lost medical records and patient's perscriptions. Maybe it's best you leave him alone to actually work today.",

    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Fall.MidHeart.1": "%You overhear Harvey mumbling to himself.#$b#Hm, oh, sorry {{LPetName}}. I just...#$b#Ugh, I have so much work to do this time of year, it being flu season and all.$s#$b#Why don't you keep me company for a bit?",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Fall.MidHeart.2": "Oh, hold on. You look...$a#$b#%Harvey presses his fingers to your throat, feeling for any abnormalities.#$b#Do me a favor, say 'ahh'.#$b#Mmm. Just what I thought.$a#$b#You need some rest. You look like you might come down with a cold if you don't bundle up, {{LPetName}}.$s",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Fall.MidHeart.3": "I could really go for a cup of coffee right now...$s#$b#Ugh, there's nothing better than a fresh cup on a cold day like this.$h#$b#Speaking of, I was just about to go put another pot of my favorite brew on, would you like some?",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Fall.MidHeart.4": "You aren't still going into the mines, are you?$a#$b#{{PetName}}, you know better than that. You could risk making your condition worse.$a#$b#At least tell me before you go down, yeah? That way I can stock up on extra supplies when I sa-$s#$b#Err... If you come into the office afterwards. ",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Fall.MidHeart.5": "You are maintaining a good diet, right, {{LPetName}}?$a#$b#I know treats like Gus' pizza are good for its price, but make sure you're still eating veggies.$a#$b#You can't indulge in too much greasy food in your condition.$s",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Fall.MidHeart.6": "I know you're growing a few pumpkins on your farm, if you intend to carve them please be careful, I wouldn't want you cutting yourself on accident.$s#$b#You can always bring them to me, I mean, believe it or not I know my way around a bone saw, so how hard could a carving knife be?$h",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Fall.MidHeart.7": "Ugh, all this lab work I've been doing has really been making my head spin.$s#$b#Honestly, I think it's the loneliness making it worse.$s#$b#Say, why don't you come and keep me company one of these days?#$b#It'd make it a hell of a lot more enjoyable running your results with you there next to me.$l",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Fall.MidHeart.8": "Y'know, it's a little too cold to be wearing something like that, especially with your disease.$a#$b#Go back home and bundle up. As your doctor, the last thing I want is for you to get worse.$a",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Fall.MidHeart.9": "Ugh, sometimes I think about moving to the city for a better chance at a successful clinic, but...$s#$b#...$s#$b#I don't know, something about a peaceful life on a farm has been drawing me back into staying.$l",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Fall.MidHeart.10": "Tch. My fingers are already starting to go numb and it's only fall.$s#$b#Hmm... Maybe some skin to skin contact would help get my blood flowing properly again.#$b#What do you think?$l",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Fall.MidHeart.11": "Aww, {{LPetName}}. You always look so cute running around doing your errands, but...#$b#Are you sure you should be doing all this in your condition?$s",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Fall.MidHeart.12": "$y 'You seem a bit stressed, are you alright?_It's all the farmwork..._Aww, {{LPetName}}. You need to take it easy. Someone in your health shouldn't work too hard.$h_It's the disease..._Aww, {{LPetName}}. You're doing an amazing job taking care of it though! I'm sure you'll live a long life despite it.$h'",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Fall.MidHeart.13": "Are you always this kind to everyone? Or just me.#$b#Or... Is it just because I'm your doctor?$s#$b#You don't have to put on a fascade around me, {{LPetName}}.$s#$b#I want you to treat me like any normal friend... Or... Potentially more than.",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Fall.MidHeart.14": "Ugh, this weather would be perfect to open a book and sit next to a fireplace all day.$h#$b#Too bad I have some paperwork to finish up...$s",

    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Fall.LateHeart.1": "This season always brings the loveliest shades of reds and oranges to the leaves.#$b#...$l#$b#Hm...$l#$b#I can't wait to see just how many different shades your face can make too.$l",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Fall.LateHeart.2": "I can almost feel the winter breezes coming through already.$s#$b#Though, at least this year I can enjoy them with you.$l",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Fall.LateHeart.3": "...$l#$b#Sorry? I was staring?$7#$b#Sorry, I can't help it!$h#$b#I swear, I fall faster than the leaves whenever you're around, {{LPetName}}.$l",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Fall.LateHeart.4": "Hey, what are you doing out here?$a#$n#Someone in your condition shouldn't be running around the town like this, and you know that.$a#$b#...$a#$b#...#$b#Just make sure you get home at a decent hour, yeah?$s#$b#The only thing scarier than a flare up is a world without you, {{LPetName}}.$s",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Fall.LateHeart.5": "Ugh, flu season is so taxing on my body. I know I should be grateful for the business but...$s#$b#Hey, here's an idea.#$b#Why don't you spend the day with me?#$b#I could keep an eye on your condition and you can get good company out of it.",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Fall.LateHeart.6": "D'you know if you suck too hard on someone's neck, you could burst an artery?#$b#I've seen it happen a few times in med school, so safe to say I got a pretty good understanding of when to stop.$h#$b#Or... When not to stop.$l",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Fall.LateHeart.7": "Brrr... It's chilly out today. I can't imagine how cold winter'll get.$s#$b#Make sure you're bundled up, yeah?#$b#Can't have the town's farmer getting sick before harvest season is over.",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Fall.LateHeart.8": "I'm really started to get annoyed with all the leaves falling around, they make every floor slippery for some reason.$s#$b#Do take care, {{LPetName}}.#$b#I can't have you slipping and falling for anyone else.$a#$b#You belong to me.$l",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Fall.LateHeart.9": "Did you know the human tongue has over eight thousand tastebuds?#$b#Honestly, I've been meaning to run an experiment involving that little known fact.#$b#Care to be a subject, {{LPetName}}?$l",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Fall.LateHeart.10": "Mmmm, oh hey.#$b#Your cheeks are red, presumably from the cold?#$b#Or from me?$l#$b#Well, no matter.$h#$b#Wait, speaking of, did you know when you blush, your stomach also blushes?#$b#I thought it was a cute fact you might enjoy now that we've been talking more often.$h",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Fall.LateHeart.11": "Did you know tastebuds are replaced every ten days or so?#$b#Hmm... Maybe we should kiss so I can always keep you on mine.$l",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Fall.LateHeart.12": "I swear, I always get such a rush when you come by.$h#$b#I don't think I've personally tried any drugs that come close to the high you give me, {{LPetName}}.$l",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Fall.LateHeart.13": "Isn't it so nice getting to marry a doctor?$h#$b#I may not be the richest, but I'm probably the most knowledgable on taking proper care of you, {{LPetName}}.$l#$b#...#$b#What do you mean we're not getting married yet?$s",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Fall.LateHeart.14": "Tch. I've been needing to brush up on my anatomy lately. I can feel myself forgetting some of the basics...$s#$b#Hm, would you mind being a model for me one of these days? We can make it a date if you'd like.$l",

    // WINTER
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Winter.EarlyHeart.1": "Did I hear you sneeze?$a#$b#Well, did you know that holly leaves can be used to treat a variety of ailments, including allergy symptoms?#$b#Though, their berries can cause quite a few issues. Large quantities often leaving people bedridden.$s#$b#Right, I guess I did get off track. Did you need something for your sneezing?",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Winter.EarlyHeart.2": "Mmmm... Hot chocolate in this weather would be to die for, wouldn't you agree?#$b#Though, What really interests me would be a mocha coffee of some sort... I'll have to test that one out later.$h",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Winter.EarlyHeart.3": "Hmph, I can't believe it's been almost a year and I still have yet to properly get to know you, {{LPetName}}.$s#$b#Shall we make it a new year's resolution to get to know one another?$h",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Winter.EarlyHeart.4": "Make sure you're dripping your faucets and leaving the heat on.#$b#Yoba knows the one thing worse than a doctor's pill is a plumber's...$s",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Winter.EarlyHeart.5": "Hm? Can I help you?#$b#Sorry, this season's just busy for me and I don't have much time to socialize.$s#$b#I'll make it a mission to get to know you more after cold and flu season's over, promise.$h",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Winter.EarlyHeart.6": "Listen, I know winter means ample opportunity to make progress in the mines, but please be careful.#$b#Though I enjoy your company, having you in one of my hospital beds is far from ideal.$s",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Winter.EarlyHeart.7": "I guess I should be flattered you came all this way despite the weather, huh?$h#$b#Would you like me to fetch a blanket and some hot cocoa for you? It's the least I could do.",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Winter.EarlyHeart.8": "Fresh air is good for the body, but with this weather, spending too much time outside can be dangerous for your health.#$b#Make sure you don't wander around too much, yeah? ",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Winter.EarlyHeart.9": "Don't take this the wrong way, but please, if I do something that makes you uncomfortable, do tell me.#$b#There's nothing I hate more than to causing a patient displeasure.$s",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Winter.EarlyHeart.10": "You trust me, right? As your doctor, of course...#$b#After all, I only want what's best for you, {{LPetName}}.$l#$e#Hm? Did I say something wrong?",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Winter.EarlyHeart.11": "%You notice Harvey running his fingers through his hair, clearly stressed.#$b#Not now, @. I have a lot of work to finish.$s#$b#...$s#$b#Actually, I wouldn't mind your company. Maybe I could bounce a few ideas off of you.#$b#Do you know anything about Polyarthralgia?",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Winter.EarlyHeart.12": "Winter's your off season, right?#$b#Well, for me it's the opposite... Flu season's in full force this year and paperwork keeps piling up...$s",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Winter.EarlyHeart.13": "I was hoping you could plant this when spring comes around so it'll be ready for harvest once summer hits.#$b#Vitamin C's good for the immune system and all.[630]$h",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Winter.EarlyHeart.14": "With how cold it's gotten, I hope your fireplace is cleaned and working properly.#$b#If you need help, don't hesitate to ask. I'm more than willing to come over and take a look.$h#$b#You'd be surprised on the amount of soot-related injuries I've seen...$s",

    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Winter.MidHeart.1": "Hmm... I guess now that it's winter you finally have enough time for me—$l#$b#Err... your treatments.$7#$b#You'll be coming by a lot more frequently, right?$h",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Winter.MidHeart.2": "Please, {{LPetName}}, be sure you're drinking and eating something that's nice and warm during this cold season.$s#$b#I'd offer a suggestion, but I don't want to be too forward just yet.$l",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Winter.MidHeart.3": "You look a bit flush, are you feeling alright?$8#$b#I don't have my thermometer on me, but using my lips against your forehead would quickly test if you're running a fever.#$b#Could I try?$l",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Winter.MidHeart.4": "...$a#$b#Ugh, sorry, I just can't put my name on—$a#$b#Oh, Crocus! That's what it's called...$h#$b#Anyways, did you know that the spice harvested from the flower has several terribly interesting medicinal properties, @?#$b#It has anti-depressant, anti-inflammatory, and… sedative properties.$l",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Winter.MidHeart.5": "Oh, you're shivering!$8#$b#$y 'Here, come with me, I'll get you something warm to drink and a blanket, yeah?_I'd rather you warm me up yourself._Oh... @... I love where you're thinking but you're still getting the blanket. Doctor's orders.$h_Thank you..._Anything for my favorite patient.$h'",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Winter.MidHeart.6": "Jeez, I can't believe the year's already coming to an end.$s#$b#Am I crazy or do I feel like I barely know you? I know I have all your medical records but...#$b#I want to know everything about you, petname.$l",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Winter.MidHeart.7": "Oh, your lips look dry.$8#$b#I mean, if you're interested, I have a salve or two which might be able to help.$l",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Winter.MidHeart.8": "If you're ever needing a change of scenery, feel free to rest in my apartment above the clinic.#$b#Knowing where you are means I worry less anyway.$h",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Winter.MidHeart.9": "I swear, I knew from the moment we met that you'd be someone special to me.$l#$b#Do you think we could professional relationship aside and get to know each other better?$l",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Winter.MidHeart.10": "...$a#$b#Hm? Oh, sorry, I got into a tussle with another patient this morning.#$b#I guess they can't all be as {{LDescript}} as you.$h",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Winter.MidHeart.11": "%Harvey seems distracted, listing a few conditions and their known symptoms, almost like he's quizzing himself so he won't forget.#$b#...#$b#...$8#$b#Oh, @! Sorry, didn't see you there.$h#$b#Yoba, with the way you keep sneaking up on me, it can't be good for my heart.$s",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Winter.MidHeart.12": "Oh, you look stressed today. Is it the disease flaring up?$s#$b#Do you need to come to the back and rest for a bit? You worry me, {{LPetName}}.$s",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Winter.MidHeart.13": "I've been reading the most fascinating journal lately. It's been giving me some wonderful ideas for new treatments on your condition.$h#$b#I hope this doesn't make you feel like too much of a guinea pig, but I can't help it.$h",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Winter.MidHeart.14": "Hey, I know it's a little early but, I was hoping you'd wear this.#$b#I found it outside the mines and the light reminded me so much of your eyes.[888]$l",

    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Winter.LateHeart.1": "Oh, you're shivering... Here, let me help.$8#$b#%Harvey takes your hands, bringing them to his lips, seemingly to ghost his lips over them.#$b#Sorry, I needed to be selfish. My lips were blue from the cold as well.$l",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Winter.LateHeart.2": "Do you have enough blankets and firewood?#$b#I know that house must be cold without me in it.$s",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Winter.LateHeart.3": "Mmmm... Days like this always make me want to cuddle up next to a fireplace with my favorite person...$l#$b#Maybe partake in some more 'warming' activities as well...$l",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Winter.LateHeart.4": "Have you ever made snow angels before?#$b#Well, I'm sure with how angelic you are, {{LPetName}}, they'd be perfect every time.$l",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Winter.LateHeart.5": "Oh, I hate to sound needy but could you spend the night?#$b#My heater ran out and it's too cold to sleep without someone else...$l",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Winter.LateHeart.6": "Has anyone ever told you just how warming your smile is?$l#$b# I swear, it always feels like a few degrees rise when we're in the same room.$l",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Winter.LateHeart.7": "Y'know, the best way for me to monitor your health is for you to come by more often.#$b#Or, I could move in finally. I know that little farmhouse of yours is cold without me.$l",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Winter.LateHeart.8": "You know a kiss could increase a person's pulse rate to 100 beats per minute or more?#$b#I mean, I've got a stethoscope at the ready if you'd like to try.$l",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Winter.LateHeart.9": "...$l#$b#Sorry, sometimes I like to imagine what it'd be like if our roles were reversed.$l#$b#It'd be cute to see you taking care of me, but I think it'd be best if we kept the medicine to me, yeah, {{LPetName}}?$h",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Winter.LateHeart.10": "I had the strangest dream about you last night...$h#$b#Say, do you think it'd be hard to tie you down? Maybe rope would do the trick or...$l#$b#No, you'd need something more medicinal...$l",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Winter.LateHeart.11": "Until we can observe local traditions, I was hoping you could...#$b#Err... I was hoping you could wear this. I wanted you to have something that'd symbolize my ever growing love and want for you, {{LPetName}}... [527]$h#$b#I hope it'll guide you back to me if you ever get lost.$l",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Winter.LateHeart.12": "Hey, I got you something that I thought you'd like. [74]$h#$b#Hm? Where'd I get a prismatic shard?#$b#Oh... Er... Marlon gave it to me last time I went up near the mines to...$s#$b#Sorry, do the details really matter?$s",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Winter.LateHeart.13": "Here, this is for you. [72]#$b#Did you know that diamonds are actually made after being subjected to intense heat and pressure?#$b#I'd love to see how you'd turn out under similar conditions...$l",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Winter.LateHeart.14": "...$l#$b#Sorry, your cheeks have such a lovely pink glow to them in this weather.$h#$b#I swear, I wish you'd hide away in my apartment so only I could be the one to see you like this.$l",

