    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Conversation.Carrots": "D'you know the old myth of carrots stems from one of the first world wars?#$b#Apparently, the radars Ferngill Republic developed stumped the Gotoro empire so bad that they resolved that our pilots ate a lot of carrots.$h#$b#Interesting how things like that work, yeah?",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Conversation.Cranberries": "I noticed you recently harvested a batch of cranberries, say, do you think I could get a batch of them one of these days?#$b#I've been thinking about experimenting with herbal remedies lately and they're perfect for U—#$b#Err, a handful of gynelogical problems.",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Conversation.AncientFruit": "I haven't really done much research into them, but I'm sure there's some sort of herbal remedy ancient fruit might be able to concoct.#$b#Who knows? It might even help that disease of yours.$h",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Conversation.Starfruit": "Hm... I don't know how I feel about you growing so much starfruit, {{LPetName}}.$s#$b#Do take care not to indulge too much into your own supply.#$b#With your condition, they might have adverse effects on your kidney and...$s#$b#Huh, do I even have a dialysis machine anymore?$s", 
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Conversation.Hops": "Did you know hops are classified as a sedative?#$b#Chemistry sure has a remarkable way of convincing the body to cooperate, doesn't it, {{LPetName}}?$l", 
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Conversation.Coffee": "Did you know coffee was one of many natural stimulants? I know it helps a lot when I'm working late at the office.$h#$b#You should try brewing some of the beans you grow, I'd love a chance to taste coffee straight from the source.",

    // SVE
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Conversation.Cucumber": "%You overhear Harvey muttering something about having a craving for homemade pickles. Huh... Didn't you grow some cucumbers recently? It might be a good idea to make some.",
 
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Mines.40": "You seem so set on diving deep in those mines don't you?$s#$b#I guess as your doctor I can't do too much about it but...$a#$b#Oh, how I wish you were a lot more careful with that disease of yours, {{LPetName}}.$s",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Mines.80": "80 floors?$s#$b#{{PetName}}, I've told you just how fragile your condition is.$s#$b#I'm beginning to think you're a glutton for punishment.$a",
    // Skull Caverns 
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Mines.121": "Oh @, I know you contracted the disease from our local mines, but seriously?$a#$b#Resulting to taking a bus for minerals?$a#$b#I'm sure that place is just as bad as ours if not worse.$a",

