    // Day After 
    "AfterDark.FestivalJealousy.Harvey.HasPartner.Alex.Memory": "Was it fun being jerked around by Alex yesterday?$a#$b#It's beyond me how that man still doesn't know the dance when it's so simple.$s",
    "AfterDark.FestivalJealousy.Harvey.HasPartner.Elliott.Memory": "You'd think with all that time reading, Elliott would've been able to properly sweep you off your feet yesterday, {{LPetName}}.$s#$b#It was pathetic, you could practically see his nerves sticking up.$a",
    "AfterDark.FestivalJealousy.Harvey.HasPartner.Sam.Memory": "Do you really believe you're the first person he's looked at in that way, {{LPetName}}?$s#$b#I suppose charm does lose its magic once you realize how often it's been practiced.$s", 
    "AfterDark.FestivalJealousy.Harvey.HasPartner.Sebastian.Memory": "I couldn't help but notice how uncomfortable Sebastian was at the dance yesterday.$s#$b#He looked as uncomfortable as ever.$s#$b#Tell me, {{LPetName}}, how often do you find yourself asking him to love the things you do?$a#$b#Eventually, people stop pretending.$s",
    "AfterDark.FestivalJealousy.Harvey.HasPartner.Shane.Memory": "I'm surprised the smell of beer didn't put you off yesterday.$s#$b#I'll expect to see you in my office later.#$b#I'm sure Shane's drunken stumbling no doubt bruised your lovely feet.$a",

    "AfterDark.FestivalJealousy.Harvey.HasPartner.Abigail.Memory": "Y'know, with all the things Abigail eats, I'm surprised she was even able to show up yesterday.$s", 
    "AfterDark.FestivalJealousy.Harvey.HasPartner.Haley.Memory": "Haley was so focused on becoming flower queen yesterday, she barely paid attention to you.$s#$b#Why'd you decide to dance with her?$a",
    "AfterDark.FestivalJealousy.Harvey.HasPartner.Emily.Memory": "Emily looked more focused on showing off her own moves yesterday than on you, {{LPetName}}.$s#$b#Next time you should dance with someone who'll give you the attention you deserve.$l",
    "AfterDark.FestivalJealousy.Harvey.HasPartner.Leah.Memory": "The flower dance suits Leah so well... She has a remarkable eye for beauty after all.#$b#Though, you should be careful with her, {{LPetName}}.$s#$b#The cruel thing about muses is that they aren't remembered for who they are, only for what they gave the artist.$s",
    "AfterDark.FestivalJealousy.Harvey.HasPartner.Maru.Memory": "Was it fun dancing with Maru yesterday?$a#$b#I'm honestly just surprised her movements weren't more... robotic.$s",
    "AfterDark.FestivalJealousy.Harvey.HasPartner.Penny.Memory": "You danced beautifully with Penny yesterday.#$b#I only hope she sees you as an equal, not another promise she's made to herself.$s",

    // Otherwise Day After
    "AfterDark.FestivalJealousy.Harvey.HasPartner.Harvey.Memory": "Were you nervous yesterday, {{LPetName}}?#$b#I swear, the only thing I could think about yesterday was how fast your heart was racing.$l#$b#Maybe I should conduct a quick exam on you, yeah?#$b#It couldn't possibly be that healthy to maintain such a high heart rate for an extended period of time...$h",
    "AfterDark.FestivalJealousy.Harvey.HasPartner.NotHarvey.Memory": "You looked happy out there yesterday.$s#$b#I wonder... was it because someone finally made you feel chosen or because you were so willing to believe they did?$s#$b#I'd prefer making sure you never have to question that feeling it at all.#$b#I'll see you next Tuesday, {{LPetName}}.$s",

    /*-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
     BACHELORS
    ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- */

    // Alex
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Jealous.Dating.Alex": "I heard about Alex's dad, @.$s#$b#You should steer clear of people like that... It tends to be genetic.$s",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Jealous.Married.Alex": "Y'know, I don't really see how Alex could help you out on the farm.$a#$b#He's already a failed gridball player, I wouldn't want him to fail you as well.$s",
    "AfterDark.Jealousy.Harvey.Late.Alex.1": "George and Evenlyn speak so highly of you.#$b#I do hope you're steering clear of Alex though, a kid like that isn't suited to care for your needs, {{LPetName}}.$s",
    "AfterDark.Jealousy.Harvey.Late.Alex.2": "Careful around him, {{LPetName}}.$s#$b#Alex had numerous concussions back when he regularly played gridball.#$b#I wouldn't be surprised if he was no longer fully there.$s",
                                                                
    // Elliott                               
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Jealous.Dating.Elliott": "When will you realize all those fantasies he offers is fake, {{LPetName}}?$a#$e#What? You know who I'm talking about.$s",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Jealous.Married.Elliott": "You know he'll leave you on the whim of a promising book, right?$s#$b#Who's to say he wouldn't leave you for longer, {{LPetName}}?$s#$b#You need a man who'll take care of you.$l",
    "AfterDark.Jealousy.Harvey.Late.Elliott.1": "I heard tetanus shots hurt.#$b#I mean—I wouldn't know, but one of my patients continously comes in talking about a new scrape from one of the many failed construction points he has around his shack.$s",
    "AfterDark.Jealousy.Harvey.Late.Elliott.2": "You don't seriously believe all those promises Elliott makes you, do you?$s#$b#I mean, at the end of the day, beautiful lies are still lies, {{LPetName}}.$s",

    // Sam
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Jealous.Dating.Sam": "Do you really think your grandpa would approve of him, {{LPetName}}?$s#$b#Do him and yourself a favor and end things with Sam. He's not worth your precious time and effort.$a#$e#$y 'I meant what I said, @. He wouldn't approve of him._Who would he approve of?_Well, someone like me—Er, someone with a stable job of course.$h_Who are you to say that?_I'm just thinking about what's best for you, {{LPetName}}.$a'",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Jealous.Married.Sam": "That man can barely takes care of himself, {{LPetName}}.$a#$b#I've seen Sam's bloodwork. You really should rethink your desire to spend the rest of your life with him.$s",
    "AfterDark.Jealousy.Harvey.Late.Sam.1": "Tch...$s#$b#Y'know, Sam really does have confidence, but I've found that often compensates for something else.$s",
    "AfterDark.Jealousy.Harvey.Late.Sam.2": "Sam's always been good at making people feel like they're the only one.#$b#I wonder how many people actually believe that.$s",

    // Sebastian
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Jealous.Dating.Sebastian": "Motorcycle deaths are fairly common nowadays, {{LPetName}}.$s#$b#You really should be careful dating someone who so easily hops on those death machines.$a",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Jealous.Married.Sebastian": "...$a#$b#I doubt his infatuation for you would supersede his addiction to smoking.$a#$b#Look past the haze, {{LPetName}}. He'd drop you for another chance to get high.$s",
    "AfterDark.Jealousy.Harvey.Late.Sebastian.1": "You should really be careful around Sebastian.$a#$b#I wouldn't want all that second hand smoke affecting your perfectly healthy lungs, @.$s",
    "AfterDark.Jealousy.Harvey.Late.Sebastian.2": "...$a#$b#Tell me, if you stopped visiting his basement tomorrow, how long would it take before he noticed?$a",

    // Shane 
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Jealous.Dating.Shane": "Really?$a#$b#An alcoholic?$a#$b#You can do better than him, @.$a#$b#You shouldn't have to wonder whether he's having a good day or not before making plans.$s", 
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Jealous.Married.Shane": "Careful with Shane, yeah?$s#$b#He spent years letting alcohol make the decisions for him. I wouldn't let him make yours.$s",
    "AfterDark.Jealousy.Harvey.Late.Shane.1": "You know, I'm all for recovering alcoholics, but are you sure about Shane?$s#$b#His issues stem from far before he started drinking.$s", 
    "AfterDark.Jealousy.Harvey.Late.Shane.2": "I'd be a bit more careful hanging around addicts, {{LPetName}}.$s#$b#Though not fully proven, you're more likely to develop something yourself.$s",

    /*-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
     BACHELORETTES
    ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- */

    // Abigail 
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Jealous.Dating.Abigail": "Abigail can't possibly be serious about you, {{LPetName}}.$s#$b#Have you seen the way she reacts around Sebastian at the saloon? She's baiting you, @.$a", 
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Jealous.Married.Abigail": "From the time I've known her, Abigail seems to only love the excitement of the chase.#$b#I wonder how long she'll enjoy the catch until she drops you.$s",
    "AfterDark.Jealousy.Harvey.Late.Abigail.1": "...$s#$b#You know how serious your condition is, {{LPetName}}.$a#$b#You really shouldn't be hanging around girls who spend all their time in the same mines which afflicted you.$a",
    "AfterDark.Jealousy.Harvey.Late.Abigail.2": "Please tell me you haven't been going back into those mines with Abigail, {{LPetName}}.$s#$b#You know how dangerous it is!$a#$b#For Yoba's sake, I'll have to adjust your dosing at this rate...$s",

    // Emily 
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Jealous.Dating.Emily": "Emily's 'crystal healing' is nice and all, but you should really be with someone who's more realistic about your health and safety.$a", 
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Jealous.Married.Emily": "...$s#$b#Y'know, I once heard Emily left an ex over the fact their horoscopes didn't align anymore.$s#$b#What's stopping her from leaving you at the whim of the stars?$a",
    "AfterDark.Jealousy.Harvey.Late.Emily.1": "Careful around Emily, yeah?#$b#Alternative methods to medicine don't always work out for the best...$s", 
    "AfterDark.Jealousy.Harvey.Late.Emily.2": "...$s#$b#Sorry, I can't stop thinking about the time I treated one of our villagers for psittacosis.$s#$b#Truly disgusting stuff when you get up close and personal with it.$s#$e#...#$b#How can you get it?#$b#Oh, parrots.",

    // Haley 
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Jealous.Dating.Haley": "Someone with such delusional ideas about her own appearance will never be able to appreciate your raw beauty, {{LPetName}}.$s",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Jealous.Married.Haley": "Have you seen how Haley treats her sister, @?$s#$b#What's stopping her from being equally as obnoxious and mean to her {{LMarriageName}}?$s",
    "AfterDark.Jealousy.Harvey.Late.Haley.1": "A vapid little girl like Haley only thinks skin deep, {{LPetName}}.$s#$b#Wouldn't you rather hang out with someone who knows you more... intimately?$l", 
    "AfterDark.Jealousy.Harvey.Late.Haley.2": "Should you really be hanging around the girl who breathes more aerosol than oxygen from her hair products?$a#$b#It can't possibly be healthy being around her, {{LPetName}}.$s",

    // Leah
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Jealous.Dating.Leah": "From our appointments, Leah is so prone to getting lost in her head.#$b#Are you sure you want someone like that being in your life and helping on your Grandfather's farm?$s",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Jealous.Married.Leah": "I overheard Leah the other day talking about looking for inspiration for her newest artwork despite not finishing the last.#$b#I really wonder what'll happen to you once the novelty wears off.$s", 
    "AfterDark.Jealousy.Harvey.Late.Leah.1": "Despite being her doctor, I really have no real knowledge on Leah.#$b#All I remember were her records from the city being a real mess to decifer when she moved down.$a", 
    "AfterDark.Jealousy.Harvey.Late.Leah.2": "Do you really think Leah'll let you into that little world she created for herself?$s#$b#Artists are starving and I'd hate for you to get eaten, @.$a",

    // Maru 
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Jealous.Dating.Maru": "Maru would drop you instantly for an opportunity to advance her studies.#$b#It would break my heart to see you abandoned like that, @.$s", 
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Jealous.Married.Maru": "You've trusted me with every part of yourself, do you seriously believe Maru knows you better than I?$a",
    "AfterDark.Jealousy.Harvey.Early.Maru.1": "I've worked with Maru for a few years now.#$b#It's astonishing how little I know about her though.", 
    "AfterDark.Jealousy.Harvey.Early.Maru.2": "Try not to be too distracting to Maru, yeah?$a#$b#I pay her to help out around here for a reason.",
    "AfterDark.Jealousy.Harvey.Late.Maru.1": "Y'know, I heard a few stories of Demetrius handling dangerous chemicals with Maru.#$b#I'd really hate for you to get caught in the crossfire, {{LPetName}}.$s", 
    "AfterDark.Jealousy.Harvey.Late.Maru.2": "I've seen the way Maru's father looks at you, @.$s#$b#Are you sure you want to be involved with a family like that?$s",

    // Penny 
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Jealous.Dating.Penny": "...$s#$b#Sorry, I just can't see how a woman so at the whim of her alcoholic mother could possibly give you the attention you truly need, {{LPetName}}.$s",
    "AfterDark.Core.Harvey.Jealous.Married.Penny": "...$s#$b#Though Penny may know your favorite flower, I know the rhythm of your hearbeat, {{LPetName}}.$s#$b#Never forget that.$a",
    "AfterDark.Jealousy.Harvey.Late.Penny.1": "Addiction is generic, @.#$b#You really should stop wasting your time on those who are pre-despositioned to disappoint you.$s", 
    "AfterDark.Jealousy.Harvey.Late.Penny.2": "You've really been getting to know Penny a lot lately, haven't you?$s#$b#...$s#$b#Are you sure about her?$s#$b#Have you seen what her home life is like?$s",

