    /*-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
     ENGAGEMENT
    ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- */
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Engagement.0": "",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Engagement.1": "",

    /*-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
     PATIO
    ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- */
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Patio.1": "It's so impressive how you've managed to maintain your farm so well with your condition.$h#$b#I'm trying to follow your lead with my own plants, but I guess only you have the green thumb.$s",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Patio.2": "Hm...#$e#Oh! {{PetName}}, there you are!$h#$b#I was just brushing up on a few anatomy poses, but...#$b#Ugh. These diagrams are nothing like the real thing.$s#$b#Care to help me study later?$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Patio.3": "...$l#$b#Sorry, I can't help but stare at you sometimes. You look {{LDescript}} under the sunlight, {{LPetName}}.$l#$b#...$l#$e#Fuck, I lost my place in this book...$s",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Patio.4": "%You try and peek into the book he's reading, but he quickly shuts it.#$b#O-Oh! Petname... Uh... Sorry, I didn't see you there...$8#$b#What am I reading?#$b#Err... Don't you have a few crops to tend to or something?$s",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Patio.5": "Oh, hey.$l#$b#Say, I've been thinking about putting a little swing out here.#$b#It'd be nice to watch the sunset together on, don't you think?$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Patio.6": "Hmm... My plants out here aren't growing too well...$s#$b#D'you think you could help me out, {{LPetName}}? You're just so good at this whole gardening thing...$h",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Patio.7": "How are you feeling today, {{LPetName}}?#$b# I could go grab a few medical supplies from inside if you're needing a checkup.$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Patio.8": "Morning.$h#$b#D'you come over here to read with me? I have this amazing new edition of Zuzu's Medical Journal we can look at together.#$b#Hm, do we have a chair nearby to pull up?",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Patio.9": "Hey {{LPetName}}.$h#$b#I'm just looking over your records... and a few other things.#$b#Honestly, it's impressive just how many documents have your old last name on them.$s#$b#Don't worry, they'll all have mine soon enough.$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Patio.10": "Good morning!$h#$b#I was just reading up on the latest study and it's almost as interesting as you are.$l",

    /*-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
     SPOUSE ROOM
    ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- */
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.SpouseRoom.1": "Mmm.. Your breathing this morning sounded pretty irregular.$s#$b#Here, take your shirt back off so I can listen.$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.SpouseRoom.2": "Ah, there you are. I almost forgot to make you breakfast this morning.[201]$h#$e#Yoba, I swear, watching you sleep has become my new favorite thing about living on this farm.$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.SpouseRoom.3": "...$s#$b#It really is too bad I can't keep you on a shelf out of harm's way.$s#$b#Promise me you'll be safe today, yeah? Come home straight away if you're not feeling good and I'll fix you up.",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.SpouseRoom.4": "Y'know, you slept pretty peacefully for someone who reached a new level of soprano last night.$l#$b#Here's some tea to help that throat of yours, {{LPetName}}.[614]$h",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.SpouseRoom.5": "Good morning, here's some coffee to get your day started.[395]$h#$b#Do let me know if you start feeling unwell, yeah?#$b#You know I'll be over straight away to make you feel better.$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.SpouseRoom.6": "%You overhear Harvey sighing to himself.#$b#Hm? Oh, hey {{LPetName}}. It's nothing, just...#$b#Hm...$s#$b#Sometimes I really wish you were like one of my model planes.$s#$b#Small, easy to control, and always willing to do what I tell you.$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.SpouseRoom.7": "Good morning, I made you some eggs, but please eat them slowly.[195]#$b# I know you have a busy day today, but I don't want to see you choke on them.$h#$b#...$l#$b#Though...$l#$b#There is something else I'd rather see you choke on.$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.SpouseRoom.8": "Mmmmm...$l#$b#I don't think I'm quite awake yet, would you mind helping me?$l#$b#I mean, I know a few things you could try that'd wake me right up, {{LPetName}}.$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.SpouseRoom.9": "Aww, awake already? I was hoping to...$s#$b#Never mind. I hope you slept well last night, {{LPetName}}.#$b#You'll need the energy for later.$h",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.SpouseRoom.10": "Good morning, {{LPetName}}. How'd you sleep?$h#$b#Mmmm, it was good? I mean with how often you were mumbling and drooling last night, I bet it was a good sleep.$l",

    /*-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
     FUNLEAVE/RETURN
    -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------*/ 
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.funLeave.1": "Hey, I'm heading out for a bit today. I just need to pick up a... err. Just a few supplies.#$b#I'll bring home dinner, don't worry.$h",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.funLeave.2": "I'm heading out to do some grocery shopping today, would you like me to pick you up anything extra?#$b#Don't worry about the essentials, I know exactly what you need.$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.funLeave.3": "While I'm out today, please remember to take breaks, yeah?#$b#I know you have a tendency to overwork yourself while in the zone.$a#$b#If you get hurt, come to me immediately. Do you understand?",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.funLeave.4": "I have a few errands to run today, but don't worry, I have something special planned for tonight.#$b#I love you, stay safe, my {{LDescript}} little {{LMarriageName}}.$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.funLeave.5": "Mmm... We're running a bit low on sugar and I can't have you using your sweetness for anything other than me.$s#$b#I need to make a small trip to Pierre's, I'll be back before you know it.$h",
    
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.funReturn.1": "Mmmm... How was your day today?#$b#I thought about you while I was out...[421 595 591]$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.funReturn.2": "Hey, while I was out today I ran into Pierre and he said you might like these...#$b#Said something about them being ultra rare...[499]#$b#I don't know. I just hope you like them is all.$h",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.funReturn.3": "I just so happened to make a few stops around town...#$b#Mmmm... Close your eyes, I have a surprise for you.$h#$b#...$a#$b#I said close them.$a#$b#...#$b#Okay, open.[527]#$b#Do you like it?",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.funReturn.4": "...$s#$b#Sorry, I couldn't find ANYTHING worth getting you while I was out today...$s#$b#...$s#$b#...$h#$b#Sorry, I'm a bad liar!$h#$b#Here, I hope you like it. [74]",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.funReturn.5": "Mmmm...#$b#You didn't overwork yourself today while I was out, did you?#$b#No? Good.$h#$b#Here, I brought us back some dinner from Gus'.[224]",

    /*-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
     JOBLEAVE/RETURN         
    -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------*/ 
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.jobLeave.1": "Hey, I'm going out to work today.#$b#Don't worry though, I'll be back before you know it.$h#$b#If you start to miss me too much you can just stop by the clinic.#$b#You know I'll always take your company.$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.jobLeave.2": "As much as it pains me to leave you by yourself, I have to head to work.$s#$b#Please, make sure you stop by today. I don't think I could go a full 8 hours without seeing your smile.#s",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.jobLeave.3": "I almost wish I didn't have to keep running my clinic.$s#$b#No one else deserves my care like you do, {{LPetName}}.$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.jobLeave.4": "Y'know, even though I have to work today, I half a mind to tie you up so I know exactly where you are when I'm gone.$l#$e#C'mon, let me?$h#$b#I'll make it a point to come every other hour to take care of you.$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.jobLeave.5": "Even though I have work today, make sure you still stop by if you get hurt, yeah?#$b#You know I love being the only one able to fix you.$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.jobLeave.6": "Ugh, I wish we could stay in bed all day and just cuddle, but duty calls.$s#$b#I'll see you later today, yeah, {{LPetName}}?",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.jobLeave.7": "Oh, please don't look at me like that, {{LPetName}}.$s#$b#You know I'm weak for you and oh how I wish I could stay but...$s#$b#My patients... My clinic...$s#$b#How about tonight, after I come home, I show you just how much I really need you, hm?$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.jobLeave.8": "Ugh, I have a few tests to run and medications to fill...$s#$b#Oh, and paperwork...$s#$b#Ugh, I'm sorry, {{LPetName}}.$s#$b#I would stay here with you all day but I have so much to do at work...$s",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.jobLeave.9": "%You overhear Harvey mumbling about a few menial tasks he needs to do while at work today.#$b#Hey, {{LPetName}}. Give me a kiss before I leave for work?$h",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.jobLeave.10": "...$s#$b#Why is it on the days I have to go to work you always look so irresistable?$s#$b#Visit me today? Please?$l",
    
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.jobReturn.1": "...$s#$b#Sorry, today was such a long day at the clinic.$s#$b#Say, do you think we could go to the bathhouse to relax?#$b#Or maybe we could decompress in another way...$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.jobReturn.2": "Hey, how was your day?#$b#Personally, I couldn't focus on a damn thing due to you running through my mind.$s",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.jobReturn.3": "Y'know, it really is nice having someone to come home to when I go out.$h#$b#How was your day, {{LPetName}}?$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.jobReturn.4": "Today was such an eventful day at the clinic.#$b#One of my patients—$h#$b#Ugh, wait. I can't tell you the story without violating doctor-patient confidentiality...$s#$b#Anyways, did you have a good day today?",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.jobReturn.5": "%You hear Harvey sighing.#$b#It was such a slow day at work today, though I did get to spend all of my free time thinking of you...$s#$b#And what I wanted to do to you tonight.$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.jobReturn.6": "Today was so exhausting, {{LPetName}}.$s#$b#Here, I brought us home some dinner... Why don't we eat this, cuddle on the porch, and watch the stars tonight?[224]$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.jobReturn.7": "I will never get tired of coming home to you, {{LPetName}}.$h#$b#Every day that I see you I fall deeper in love with you.$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.jobReturn.8": "%Harvey looks exhausted from the day's work.#$b#Gah, our bed looks so good right about now.$s#$b#Ugh, what I wouldn't give to just pass out with you right now, {{LPetName}}.$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.jobReturn.9": "Ugh... After the day I had, I can't help but wonder why I don't just fully close down the clinic.$s#$b#I think I'd much rather spend my days here with you anyway.$late",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.jobReturn.10": "Hey, there you are.$h#$b#I hope you had a better day than I did cause being a doctor is...$s#$b#Well, rewarding, but days like today make me wish I could just spend all day with you.$h",

    /*-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
     SPECIAL DATES
    -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------*/ 
    // Spring 
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Spring1.1": "Agh~ I know we were all sentimental last night about the new year beginning, but, Yoba...$h#$b#Everytime I see you, {{LPetName}}, it's like I learn to breathe again.$l#$b#I'm so happy I get to spend the rest of my life with you.$h",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Spring1.2": "It's always so wonderful seeing all the plants spring back to life as the season changes.#$b#Though, I think I might have to get a new coat before next winter...#$b#I might've accidentally ripped it while clearing some leftover debris.$s",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Spring1.3": "Mmmm...#$b#Are you planting anything in specific this year?#$b#Might I suggest some parsnips or garlic?#$b#They're quite delectable when pickled.$h",

    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Spring12.1": "Why don't we just leave the egg festival to the kids this year?#$b#Me and you can stay home... Maybe watch a movie...$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Spring12.2": "I can't help but be a little spiffed with the egg festival prizes.$s#$b#All that work for a lowsy hat?$a#$b#If my {{LMarriageName}} is putting that much effort into something, {{LPPN}} at least deserve something worth {{LPPN2}} while...$a",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Spring12.3": "Ugh, the crowd at tomorrow's festival always makes me a little queezy.$s#$b#But, I guess if you're gonna be there I'll be just fine.$h",

    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Spring23.1": "Oh, there you are.#$b#I ironed our outfits for the dance tomorrow, though I don't really know how it got so wrinkled in the first place...$h#$b#Ah~ Well, maybe a few reasons why come to mind.$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Spring23.2": "Are you ready for the dance tomorrow?#$b#I know you're going to look as {{LDescript}} as ever.$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Spring23.3": "Oh, I'm getting all jittery thinking about the dance tomorrow!$h#$b#Getting to show off how {{LDescript}} my {{LMarriageName}} is really makes going there worth it.$h",

    // Summer
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Summer1.1": "Ah~ This summer's already starting to feel like one of the hottest we've had.$s#$b#Make sure you wear plenty of sunscreen, {{LPetName}}.",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Summer1.2": "I sure hope this summer won't be one of the hotter ones...$s#$b#I don't think I could handle it if our AC went out in the middle of a heatwave...$s",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Summer1.3": "%Harvey stretches, taking in the fresh summer air.#$b#Ah~ I'll never get tired of how refreshing summer feels.$h#$b#The feeling's nearly as good as you, {{LPetName}}.$l",   
     
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Summer10.1": "Have you thought of what you're putting into the soup tomorrow?#$b#I'm sure no matter what it is it'll be a perfect addition.$h",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Summer10.2": "I sure hope one of the adolescents in town don't ruin the soup tomorrow.$s#$b#I really hate seeing such hard work put to waste...$s#$b#Surely you're not one of those people, right, {{LPetName}}?#$b#If you are, I'm afraid I might have to bring you in for an emergency checkup...$a",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Summer10.3": "Mmmm...#$b#My mouth's already watering thinking about the soup tomorrow.$h#$b#Hopefully it won't be ruined and we'll have leftovers for a few days.$s",

    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Summer27.1": "Oh, I'm so looking forward to the lovely view tomorrow night.$h#$b#Ah~ Yeah, I'm sure the jellyfish'll be lovely too.$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Summer27.2": "The jellyfish sure are a pleasant sight, but after you've seen one, it almost starts to feel like you've seen them all.$s#$b#But... I uh...#$b#I don't think I'll ever get tired of how {{LDescript}} you are.$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Summer27.3": "I'm excited for the jellyfish tomorrow, are you?#$b#Ah~ You don't think anyone'll be dumb enough to jump in this year, right?$s#$b#I'll never forget the year Sam dove head first into the batch. He was stung everywhere.$h#$b#And I mean everywhere.$s",

    // Fall
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Fall1.1": "Oh, this fall is looking like it's gonna be a windy one...$s#$b#Make sure you're keeping warm, yeah?#$b#Flu season is no joke...$s",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Fall1.2": "Mmmm... Now that is fall, have you considered making pumpkin wine?#$b#Ah~ I know how weird it sounds, but I think the aroma could be quite pleasing.$h",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Fall1.3": "Isn't fall a busier season for you?#$b#Oh, do tell me you'll make time for me, right?$s#$b#I don't know if I could go too long without your love, touch, or voice, {{LPetName}}.$s",
     
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Fall15.1": "Hm?#$b#Oh, the fair is tomorrow, isn't it?#$b#Have you put any thought into what you're putting on display?#$b#Ah~ Well, I'm sure no matter what you put up, it'll be a hit as always.$h",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Fall15.2": "%You catch Harvey warming his arm up.#$b#Hey, {{LPetName}}! I'm just warming up my arm to try and win you some prizes at the fair tomorrow!$h#$b#What? Don't look at me like that. I just want to make sure you get at least one good thing tomorrow.$s",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Fall15.3": "Mmmm... The grange display is tomorrow, right?#$b#Do you have everything ready for it?#$b#Ah~ Well, hopefully you'll still have space to be able to use this as your center piece.[74]$h",  
     
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Fall26.1": "I've really never been one to dress up for Spirit's Eve, but...#$b#I don't know, I just think it'd be really nice to dress up with you, {{LPetName}}.$h#$b#Ah~ I guess marriage has made me a bit soft, hasn't it?$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Fall26.2": "I know it's quite late to be deciding this, but should we match tomorrow?#$b#I'll be a doctor if you'll be my nurse.$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Fall26.3": "I wonder if they changed up the maze this year.#$b#You know, at the Spirit's Eve festival tomorrow?#$b#Mmm... If they did, do you wanna go through it together? I think it'd be quite fun.",
    
    // Winter   
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Winter1.1": "%You notice Harvey shivering, closing his jacket tighter.#$b#Ugh...$s#$b#It always surprises me just how quickly this place turns cold.$s#$b#Oh... This means the clinic'll be packed from minor colds to slip injuries...$s#$b#I guess I should go ahead and finish up fall's paperwork...$s",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Winter1.2": "Ah, you're not wearing nearly enough layers.$a#$b#Here, take another.#$b#%Harvey wraps his jacket around you.#$b#Now make sure you keep warm this season, yeah?",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Winter1.3": "Oh, look at you.$a#$b#Your nose is already red from the weather!$a#$b#Hmm... Come sit by the fire, yeah? I'll make you a hot drink.", 
     
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Winter7.1": "Mmmm... Are you participating in the ice festival tomorrow, {{LPetName}}?#$b#...#$b#Say, do you think Willy'll let me take some of the fish home?#$b#I have a few recipes I want to try out...",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Winter7.2": "I always wonder what Willy does with all the fish that come out of tomorrow's festival.#$b#It'd be a shame if they all just went to waste...$s",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Winter7.3": "Oh, I'm excited for tomorrow's festival!$h#$b#D'you think we could get there a little early? I always like to admire how well the igloos are crafted...",
     
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Winter28.1": "Agh, has it truly been another year already?$h#$b#I can't wait to spend another with you, {{LPetName}}.$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Winter28.2": "I can't help but be excited that this year is ending already.$h#$b#It means I get to spend another with you, afterall.$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Winter28.3": "...$l#$b#Sorry, I'm just admiring the view I'll have for the new year.",
    
    /*-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
     GENERAL SEASON RELATED LINES                     
    -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------*/ 
    // Spring
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Spring.1": "Spring is such a beautiful season with everything blooming.#$b#I could certainly see our love blooming even further...$l#$b#What, too cheesy?$h",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Spring.2": "I feel like I've never asked if you liked flowers before.$s#$b#Ah~ Well, I picked this one for you anyway. [591]$h#$b#Sorry, I know I'm giving it before you said anything, but I really wanted to take advantage of this weather and gift you as many as I can.#$b#Maybe if I get another 11 I could make a full bouquet...$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Spring.3": "Agh, I love this spring weather.$h#$b#Not only that, but all the views of birds, bees...$l#$b#Wait...NO! I didn't—Not like that—$7",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Spring.4": "Is it too early in the year to go down to the lake?#$b#Ah, you're right, the water's probably still too cold to actually enjoy it...$s",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Spring.5": "The flowers and foragables in this season always look so...#$b#Delectable? Is that the right word?#$b#Ah, but of course, nothing compares to you, my love.$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Spring.6": "...$l#$b#Sorry, there's just really something about knowing I'm going to spend the rest of my life with you.$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Spring.7": "Hm?#$b#What? The flowers?#$b#Oh, yeah, they are pretty, aren't they?$h#$b#Sorry, I've just been so focused on staring at you I really haven't noticed...$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Spring.8": "%You overhear Harvey humming to himself.#$b#Oh! Don't sneak up on me like that!$8#$b#Yoba, I swear, my heart nearly jumped out of my chest.$8#$b#What am I doing?#$b#Err... Just a bit of spring cleaning... Care to join me, {{LPetName}}?$h",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Spring.9": "Mmm...$l#$b#You know what I could really go for right about now?$l#$b#Some chocolate flavored strawberries...$h#$b#Have you managed to plant any this year? It's okay if not...#$b#I'm sure Pierre might be able to spare a carton on discount anyway...",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Spring.10": "Mmmm... I know it's spring, but the weather really has been on the chillier side lately.#$b#Do make sure you're wearing layers... I'd hate for you to get a cold this early in the year.$s",

    // Summer
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Summer.1": "Summer always means less patients at the clinic...$s#$b#And with you working longer days now...$s#$b#Oh, I can't stand it!$a#$b#Why don't we go out on a date here soon, hm?#$b#You know I can't stand the thought of going too long without my amazing, {{LDescript}}, wonderful {{LMarriageName}}.$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Summer.2": "...$l#$b#Sorry, you just look so...$l#$b#{{Descript}} with your face all flush like that...$l#$b#You are drinking enough water while out there, right?$7",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Summer.3": "Ah, I think I might have to call someone out to take a look at our air conditioning.$s#$b#It keeps doing this weird thing where one minute it's a nice and cool and then shoots up to almost boiling temps!$s",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Summer.4": "...$a#$b#Why do you look so out of breath?$a#$b#Have you been taking enough breaks while out there, @?$a#$b#Here, come sit down, I'll get you a glass of water.#$b#And put your feet up, it'll help with circulation.",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Summer.5": "Make sure you're wearing a hat out there, yeah?#$b#You spend so long out there in the sun... I'd hate for you to come home with burns again...$s",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Summer.6": "I'm so envious of pilots this time of year...$s#$b#They must get such beautiful views of the valley...$s",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Summer.7": "Agh, today seems like the perfect day to take a long walk, yeah?$h#$b#How about you join me? I'm sure there's at least one spot in the valley you haven't seen yet.#$b#You can think of me as your unofficial tour guide... Wouldn't that be cute?$h",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Summer.8": "Agh, the heat is absolutely killing me.$s#$b#I've turned on three fans, but our AC just isn't catching up.$a#$b#We might have to invest in a new one soon...$s",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Summer.9": "Oh, did you see that?$8#$b#The plane above us! Oh, I'm sure it was a Douglas MD-80... Did you see how long it was?$8#$b#Ugh, do you think it's too late for me to get my camera?$h",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Summer.10": "The birds are loud today, wouldn't you agree?#$b#I'm sure if we went out right now we'd probably spot a few...#$b#Do you think we'll end up as one of those old couples who feed birds together?$h#$b#I think it'd be wonderful... Getting to that age with my favorite person...$l",

    // Fall
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Fall.1": "...$s#$b#Oh, hey. Sorry, I just...$s#$b#Ah, I don't know what's gotten into me!$h#$b#I just... I can't help but fall in love with you everytime I see you get so passionate about your work...$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Fall.2": "Sometimes I feel like the seasons in the valley change so quickly...#$b#How are you feeling? I think I heard you sneeze the other day...#$b#You aren't getting a cold, are you?$a#$b#%Harvey presses the back of his hand to your forehead.#$b#Oh, good... No fever... I guess I could let you get back to your work then...",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Fall.3": "Agh, I swear, the falling leaves make for the perfect ambiance for a date.$h#$b#...$l#$b#Speaking of, it's been a while since I've taken you on one of those, hm?$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Fall.4": "Mmm...#$b#I almost want to try something new with my coffee but...#$b#Ugh, last time I tried one of those seasonal flavors...$s#$b#Pumpkin... pumpkin sprice I think it was?#$b#SPICE!! Pumpkin spice!!$h#$b#Ah, anyways, it wasn't really the best... Kinda ruined the want to try new things...$s",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Fall.5": "Have you put any thought into what you're wearing this year for Spirit's Eve?#$b#Ah~ Wouldn't it be cute if we matched this year?$h#$b#Oh, I'm getting giddy just thinking about it! Please?$h",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Fall.6": "Ugh, if it's this cold in fall, I'm terrified of what our winter'll look like this year...$s#$b#Though... I guess this does give me more of an excuse to stay bundled up with you in bed more often, yeah?$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Fall.7": "Mmm... This weather always makes me so excited for winter and the feast...$h#$b#Oh, I can't wait to see what secret friend I get this year!$h#$b#I do hope I get you, I know just the thing to get you.$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Fall.8": "Hey, pumpkin!$h#$b#Ah~ That didn't quite feel right, did it, {{LPetName}}?$s",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Fall.9": "Agh, how's it this late in the year already?$s#$b#Oh... I'm so behind on my charting...$s#$b#Mmm... Say, why don't we go out to eat tonight?#$b#What? If I'm gonna procrastinate, I'd rather it be with my {{LDescript}} {{LMarriageName}}.$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Fall.10": "Mmm... The weather today is so... Brisk.#$b#Almost perfect for a walk.#$b#Are you almost done with your chores today?#$b#We could take a stroll down to the beach if you're up for it.$h",

    // Winter
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Winter.1": "Man, I can't wait for spring to finally roll around...#$b#I'm so tired of this cold weather...$s#$b#I mean, don't get me wrong! I love our nights huddled together, just...$8#$b#I miss the greenery I guess...$s#$b#Oh, that so came out wrong, didn't it?$s",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Winter.2": "I can't believe this year's already coming to an end.#$b#We should do something for new year's; maybe I could cook something and you could brew some of that wine you're famous for?$h",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Winter.3": "Mmm...#$b#I could seriously go for some soup my mother used to make me as a child...#$b#I wonder if I still have some of her old recipes somewhere in my stuff...",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Winter.4": "Ugh, this weather always just makes me want to stay in bed all day.$s#$b#I don't know how you do it, {{LPetName}}. Your drive to keep this farm up and running is certainly something to admire.$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Winter.5": "$y 'With the year almost coming to an end, have you accomplished everything you want?_Yes_Oh, I'm so glad! We should celebrate! Say... Do you have a spare bottle of wine brewing anywhere...$h_Not yet..._Mmm... What else could you possibly have to finish up? Why don't I help you, {{LPetName}}?'",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Winter.6": "...$s#$B#Sorry, I know I should be grateful for all the patients coming to me in winter, but...$s#$b#Yoba, my docket for next Tuesday is packed...$s",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Winter.7": "Oh, wait up! I was actually gonna follow you out today.$h#$b#It's been a while since I've made a snow angel...#$b#Oh... But I really don't want to risk getting a cold...$s",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Winter.8": "The weather channel says it's supposed to be one of the coldest days of the year tomorrow.#$b#Mmmm... Why don't you stay home tomorrow, yeah?#$b#We could cuddle... Spend all day in front of the fireplace...$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Winter.9": "Where's your spare coat?$a#$b#The amount of layers you have on can't possibly be enough for the weather out today...$a",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Winter.10": "Ah, hear me out, this might be a little unorthodox, but...#$b#Here, I made you a coffee and myself a hot chocolate.[395]#$b#I would've switched the drinks, but you're already too sweet as is.$l",

    /*-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
     RAINY DAYS                
    -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------*/ 
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Rainy.Day.Harvey": "Since the rain is taking care of the crops, why not stay inside today, hm?#$b#I'd hate for you to hate a cold, but you know I wouldn't mind nursing you back to health.$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Rainy.Day.0": "Ugh, I didn't plan for the rain today.$s#$b#Make sure you take an umbrella when you go out today, {{LPetName}}.#$b#I wouldn't want you get sick out there...$s",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Rainy.Day.1": "Have any big plans for this rainy day?#$b#I was planning on reading this new medical journal on certain sleeping medications and their side affects.#$b#Ah, yeah, normally stuff like this would put me to sleep, but...#$b#I don't know, I guess reading while its pouring might make for a relaxing day.$h",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Rainy.Day.2": "Make sure you wear sunscreen while you're out today, {{LPetName}}.#$b#Even though the sun's covered, the UV rays will still get you!$h",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Rainy.Day.3": "Mmm... Looks like today might be a work-from-home day for the both of us.$h#$b#Good news though, it means we can get ahead on your physical.$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Rainy.Day.4": "Looks like it'll be storming all day...#$b#Did you have plans today? If not, I wouldn't mind spending the day cuddled up with you reading a book or something.",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Rainy.Day.5": "Must you leave, @?$s#$b#I must admit I am feeling quite needy, especially with this weather...$s#$b#Oh, it'd mean the world to me if we just stayed home and cuddled all day, @.$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Rainy.Day.6": "%You feel Harvey tugging at your shirt.#$b#Stay home with me today?$s#$b#I love how devoted you are to your work, but let the rain do its job and you relax with me, yeah?",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Rainy.Day.7": "Where are you going dressed like that?$a#$b#Don't you know what the weather is like outside?$a#$b#Put on some warmer clothes, I can't have you catching a cold again!$a",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Rainy.Day.8": "Ah~ I absolutely love when it rains.$h#$b#It gives me a legitimate excuse to stop you from leaving.$l#$b#I mean, we wouldn't want you to get sick after all, right?$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Rainy.Day.9": "Mmmmm... Come on, {{LPetName}}, stay home with me, won't you?#$b#What if I begged a little harder, hm?$l#$b#C'mon... The rain's already doing half your job, the farm'll survive one day without you.$s",
    
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Rainy.Night.Harvey": "Oh, you shouldn't have gone out today, {{LPetName}}.$s#$b#Surely the rain'll make your condition worse...$s#$b#Come, let's get you dried off and into bed so I can check over you.",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Rainy.Night.0": "Did you stay warm while out today?#$b#Ah-You're tracking in so much mud!$8#$b#Here, take off your boots and let me clean you off...$a",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Rainy.Night.1": "%Harvey grabs your wrist, seemingly to check your pulse.#$b#As I thought... With a pulse like this your blood pressure must be through the roof!$a#$b#Here, take off your boots and go have a seat, I'll start the fire to warm you up.",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Rainy.Night.2": "Oh, there you are! How was your day?$h#$b#I was actually looking at the latest catalogue on remote controlled planes...#$b#I bet with all this open air it might be a fun activity for us to play with.$h#$b#What do you think?",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Rainy.Night.3": "...$s#$b#Look at you, soaked thing.$s#$b#Here, let's get you into some dry clothes and I'll start the fire.#$b#How was your day, dear?$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Rainy.Night.4": "Ah~You're home a bit early.$h#$b#I made us some dinner, hopefully the warm meal'll ease the side effects of you being out in the rain all day.[219]",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Rainy.Night.5": "Hopefully the rain'll lower tonight's temperature and we should be able to save a bit on heating and...#$b#Hm? I was just going to say use more blankets, why are you so red?$h",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Rainy.Night.6": "You look like you could use a good, thorough massage tonight.$l#$b#Come, sit down and let me help you relax, doctor's orders.$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Rainy.Night.7": "...$a#$b#You should've been home hours ago!$a#$b#Look at you, all soaked and trembling from the rain.$s#$b#Tch, here, take off your clothes, let me get you something warmer.$a",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Rainy.Night.8": "Gah, I know this sounds lame, but I can't help but wonder how this weather impacts aeroplanes.$h#$b#Do you think they've had to ground a few planes today?#$b#Ah, I sure hope not... That sounds like a lot of wasted fuel, money, time, effort...$s#$b#Oh, how was your day?#$b#You look drenched...$s",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Rainy.Night.9": "Oh my, is it evening already?$8#$b#Gah, I swear, my days are starting to blend together!$h#$b#Not that I'm complaining, of course...$l",

    /*-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
     INDOOR/OUTDOOR               
    -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------*/ 
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Indoor.Day.Harvey": "What are your plans for today, my {{LDescript}} {{LMarriageName}}?#$b#I think I'm gonna stick my nose in a new medical journal that came in the mail...$h",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Indoor.Day.0": "I was thinking of putting on music and finalizing some medical reports today, you?#$b#Ah~ I'm almost jealous of how busy your days can get.$h#$b#Here, this should help get your day started.[201]",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Indoor.Day.1": "Good morning, {{LPetName}}. How'd you sleep?#$b#Here, I added something special to your breakfast this morning.$h#$b#What? It was just bacon. I thought you'd need the extra protein for your plans today.[201]$a",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Indoor.Day.2": "...$l#$b#You look so {{LDescript}} when you sleep, you know that?$l#$b#Almost makes me feel insane knowing when I first saw you I was too nervous to approach you.$h#$b#Though... That day was one of the happiest in my life.$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Indoor.Day.3": "Ah, you look tired, did you get enough rest?$s#$b#Wouldn't you rather stay home all day with me anyway...$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Indoor.Day.4": "Make sure you drink plenty of water while you're out there today, yeah?#$b#Can't have you passing out on me again...$s#$b#I love you, but you scare the ever loving crap out of me when you do that, @.$s",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Indoor.Day.5": "%You catch Harvey shoving a small vial into his pocket. He's almost startled when he sees you.#$b#Hm? Oh, sorry... Ah~$8#$b#Completely unrelated, but you drool a little when you sleep.$h#$b#It's cute.$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Indoor.Day.6": "You talk a lot in your sleep, you know that?$h#$b#I think I should start keeping a journal of all the cute little things you say while knocked out.$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Indoor.Day.7": "Mmm... Good morning, my {{LDescript}} little {{LMarriageName}}.$l#$b#Did you sleep well? Here, I made an extra batch just to help get your day started.[395]",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Indoor.Day.8": "...$l#$b#Can you pinch me? I think I'm still dreaming...$l#$b#Afterall, I have an Angel standing right in front of me.$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Indoor.Day.9": "...$s#$b#Do you have to go so early?$s#$b#Please, how about you just stay home all day with me, yeah?#$b#I promise, I'll make it worth your while.$l",

    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Indoor.Night.Harvey": "Ah! You look exhausted! Here, have a seat and let me give you a massage...$8#$b#I was actually just reading something in a medical journal about massages being one of the best ways to improve muscle tension, blood circulation, and reducing stress horomones.$h",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Indoor.Night.0": "Oh good, you're back earlier than normal!$h#$b#Let me run you a bath and you can tell me all you've done today, yeah?$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Indoor.Night.1": "...$s#$b#...$8#$b#Oh, you're back!$8#$b#Sorry, I was so deep in thought while you were gone...$h#$b#...#$b#What was I thinking about?#$b#...What time you'd be home...$s",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Indoor.Night.2": "...I know you have all that farmwork to do, but do you have to take so long?$s#$b#I miss you when you're gone a while, you know that?$s",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Indoor.Night.3": "Sorry, I think I'm still seeing medical reports in my vision.$s#$b#I spent over 9 hours straight today just going through them...$s#$b#Yeah, yeah, I know I should take it easy, but it's hard to when I see you do so much more in your day.#$b#Can you blame me for trying to make you proud, @?$h",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Indoor.Night.4": "Oh, hey, how was your day today, {{LPetName}}?#$b#I, personally, spent my day doing some light reading, working on a model plane...#$b#Thinking of you...$l#$b#Ah, sorry, I feel like I've been making every conversation about you.$h#$b#It's just so hard to talk about anything else when... Well, when you're you.$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Indoor.Night.5": "Did you hear the planes that went overhead today? I don't think I've seen a fleet of planes like that in years...$h#$b#Maybe the last time was... Well, before I met you I think.#$b#It's crazy how much time changes us, don't you think?",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Indoor.Night.6": "How's the soreness after today, hm?#$b#Maybe I could prescribe something like a massage to help you relax after all that heavy lifting, hm?$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Indoor.Night.7": "Ah, it's quiet nights like these that really make me remember our little trip in the air together.$h#$b#Oh, what I wouldn't give to see that look on your face again.$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Indoor.Night.8": "...$a#$b#You have a new cut on your leg there.$a#$b#Here, have a seat on the couch and let me properly bandage that.#$b#Tch. What would you do without me here at your service, hm?$s",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Indoor.Night.9": "Oh, you don't look good.$a#$b#Here, have a seat and let me test your reflexes.#$b#Mmmm... Though, tonight, why don't you just focus on the sensations, yeah?$l",

    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Outdoor.Harvey": "It's the perfect day to get some vitamin D, don't you think?$l#$b#Ah~ Not that kind, pervert!$7",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Outdoor.0": "...You look absolutely divine under the sunlight, you know that?$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Outdoor.1": "Ah, look at all this land!$h#$b#It still sometimes surprises me that we live out in such a beautiful area.#$b#I think this might just be the best place to raise kids, don't you agree?",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Outdoor.2": "Do you mind if I watch you work for a bit, {{LPetName}}?#$b#Actually, did you put on sunscreen yet? The sun's beating down like crazy.$a",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Outdoor.3": "Mmmm... Going out already, {{LPetName}}?#$b#Give me a kiss before you go, yeah? I'll be here for a bit longer if you need me...$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Outdoor.4": "...$l#$b#Forgive me for staring, but...$l#$b#Ah, I can't help but just picturing your cardiovasular system.$l#$b#Sorry, Sorry! I know it sounds strange. I just...$h#$b#I don't know, sometimes I just wish I could see the heart that beats for me.$l#$b#...Does it still sound odd?",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Outdoor.5": "Yoba, I don't think I could ever get used to the beautiful views here.$h#$b#Hm? Oh, I meant you of course. The farmland is just an added bonus.$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Outdoor.6": "%Farm really is beautiful up close, isn't it? I spent so far looking at it from afar that I...#$b#Huh? What? Did I say something strange?#$b#{{Petname}}, I knew we'd end up together from day one, you should know this by now.$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Outdoor.7": "I know I have my shortcomings but, {{LPetName}}, I'll stay loyal to you for the rest of my life.$l#$b#Whatever you ask of me, I'll do it.$l#$b#It's the least I could do after... all that I put you through.$s",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Outdoor.8": "Yoba, the air out here is so... clean.$h#$b#It feels amazing knowing that I get to spend the rest of my life with you, here.$h#$b#And hopefully it'll be a long time...$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Outdoor.9": "I love how dedicated you are to your work.$l#$b#Do you mind if I sit and watch you for a bit? I'm procrastinating some medical reports, but...#$b#Watching you sounds so much better.$l",

    /*-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
     KIDS   
    -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------*/ 
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.OneKid.0": "I always knew you'd make a good parent, you know that?$l#$b#%Kid1 is one of the healthiest, smartest kids I've seen.$h",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.OneKid.1": "Ugh, I love our little family so much.#$b#I can't wait to see what type of person %kid1 grows up into.$h",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.OneKid.2": "Ah, I know it wasn't easy, but I'm so happy we have %kid1 in our lives.$h#$b#Sometimes they really make me want a second...",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.OneKid.3": "Oh, I can't wait until %kid1 gets older. I just know they're gonna love building little model aeroplanes with me.$h",

    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.TwoKids.0": "Can I just say how much I love how %Kid1 and %kid2 both look so much like you?#$n#I always hoped to have more of you to love.$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.TwoKids.1": "Yesterday, %kid1 taught %kid2 how to say 'Papa'.$h#$b#I almost started crying on the spot, you should've seen them.",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.TwoKids.2": "Life feels so perfect with you, {{LPetName}}.$l#$b#Ah~ Before I forget, I'm taking %kid1 and %kid2 out to town later, maybe you could meet us at Gus' for a late lunch?",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.TwoKids.3": "Mmm... Sometimes I look at our kids and wonder which one'll turn into the doctor and the other a farmer.#$b#Maybe they'll throw us a curve ball and become neither.$h",

    /*-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
     AFFECTION    
    -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------*/ 
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Good.0": "Oh, your face is red. Is it hot outside?#$b#...#$b#Or is it just cause I'm here?$h#$b#...$s#$b#Sorry, was that too cheesy?$s",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Good.1": "%You notice Harvey spacing out.#$b#Hm? Oh, sorry, I was just thinking about our wedding night.$h#$b#Mmm... What's that? You think you need a reminder?$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Good.2": "Mmmm... Where are you going dressed like that?$l#$b#Nu-uh, doctor's orders, you're staying home.$h#$b#Can't have you spreading whatever madness got into you across town today.",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Good.3": "I swear, even after drinking all this coffee I have had so much less energy lately.$s#$b#Mmmm... What are you doing to me, @?$l#$b#You just take all the stamina out of me, don't you?$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Good.4": "...$l#$b#Sorry, I swear, every time I manage to get a glimpse of you, it pulls me deeper and deeper in thought.$h#$b#What am I thinking about?#$b#Ah, why don't you give me a chance to show you, hm?$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Good.5": "%Harvey grabs your hand, spinning you around and dipping your head down, kissing your neck as you lean further back.#$b#Mmmm... I swear, when you look like that, {{LPetName}}, it reminds me exactly why I'm obsessed with you.$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Good.6": "I swear, if the board new of all the unorthodox methods I do to keep you healthy...$s#$b#Hm? What methods have I used?#$b#Ah~ Well, don't you remember last night?$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Good.7": "Agh~ Are you done with all your chores for today?$s#$b#I think I'm starting to get stir crazy... I don't know if I could go the rest of the day without you.$h#$b#Hmm... How about you stay here with me for the rest of the day and I could give you another anatomy lesson, yeah?$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Good.8": "Ah, there you are.#$b#I was listening to the radio earlier and I couldn't help but think of you as they played back-to-back love songs.$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Good.9": "I swear, you can't be good for my heart.$h#$b#Every time you walk back in that door, my blood pressure spikes in ways I can't even describe.$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Good.10": "Can I tell you a secret?$l#$b#%Harvey leans in close, his hand running down the small of your back as his lips ghost against your ear.#$b#I'm desperate for you, @.$l#$b#Last night wasn't enough.$l#$b#%Harvey's grip on your back tightens.#$b#Stay home with me, you're done with your chores for today.$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Good.11": "Mmmm... What's the temperature outside? You're sweating...#$b#Here, why don't you take a break, yeah? You work too hard, {{LPetName}}.",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Good.12": "...$a#$b#Come here, sit down. You're very clearly out of breath from all that running around you do.$a#$b#...$a#$b#@...$s#$b#Y'know, if you won't listen to me as your doctor, at least listen to me as your husband when I voice my concerns.$s#$b#I only want what's best for you. Now sit down.",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Good.13": "Are you supraventricular tachycardia?#$b#Because you’re making my heart beat wildly out of rhythm, @...$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Good.14": "Ah, there you are!$h#$b#Yoba, I know it hasn't even been half a day, but I can't stop thinking about you.$s#$b#I swear, you're like a drug I can't detox from.$h#$b#...Not that I'd want to anyway.$l",

    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Neutral.0": "I know you have a busy day today, but please take care of yourself and come home on time, yeah?#$b#I really don't want to find you passed out on the road again.$s",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Neutral.1": "Ugh...$s#$b#My mustache is getting a little wild.$s#$b#Maybe you could sit on my lap and trim it up for me?$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Neutral.2": "%You overhear Harvey mumbling a few numbers off the top of his head. He looks focused.#$b#Hm? Oh, sorry, {{LPetName}}. I'm just running through a few expenses for the clinic...#$b#I think we might break even this month.",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Neutral.3": "Have you changed something in your routine lately?#$b#Ah, it's nothing. You've just looked so {{LDescript}} lately.$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Neutral.4": "Make sure you're not working too hard out there, yeah?#$b#I know I'm trained in first aide, but seeing you hurt really does something to me...$s#$b#And not in a good way.$a",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Neutral.5": "Oh, what I wouldn't give for a cup of coffee right about now...$h#$b#Though, seeing you now is suddenly giving me a delectable boost of energy.$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Neutral.6": "Hey, how's the farm out there? I haven't had a chance to go out and see for myself yet...#$b#Ah, I'm sure it's just as perfect as you are.$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Neutral.7": "Mmm... Are you heading out again or are you staying for the night?#$b#I have a movie and a few snacks ready if you're done for the day.",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Neutral.8": "Mmm... There you are.$h#$b#How're your chores doing? Are you finished yet?#$b#I could get started on dinner early if so...",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Neutral.9": "Do you have a lot left to do today?#$b#I think I'm going to start building this new model airplane I got...",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Neutral.10": "Say, what has my {{LDescript}} little {{LMarriageName}} been growing lately?#$b#Is it strawberry season? Ugh, what I would've give for a batch of them right now...$h",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Neutral.11": "Ah~ Have I ever told you how good you always seem to smell?$l#$b#Even after all that farm work...$l#$b#You make it hard for me to think straight, you know that?$h",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Neutral.12": "Y'know, I don't think I ever really believed in Yoba until you came along...$l#$b#I mean, when you look like that, it's hard to believe the divine don't exist...$l",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Neutral.13": "Mmm... What do you think about oysters for dinner?#$b#Wait... Are you back early? Oh... Do I still have time to cook?$8#$b#Maybe we should just order from Gus' tonight...$s",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Neutral.14": "Please never ask me to help with the animals again.$s#$b#One of the cows chewed my hair...$s#$b#Oh, can you look and see if I have a bald spot, {{LPetName}}? I swear there's one there now...$s",

    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Bad.0": "What did I do wrong? Was I too overbearing with your treatments?$s#$b#Why are you treating me like this, {{LPetName}}?$s",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Bad.1": "Can't you stay home today?$s#$b#It feels like we never spend time together anymore...$s",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Bad.2": "Please, {{LPetName}}.$s#$b#I'll give everything that I am to you if you could just talk, smile, anything to me.$s#$b#The silence is killing me here, @. I need you back.$s",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Bad.3": "Listen, I know what I did was bad, but it was for us!#$b#Please, think about it. Can anyone truly take care of you like I do?$l#$b#Just talk to me again, please, {{LPetName}}. Anything. I won't give up on us.$s",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Bad.4": "You don't talk to me much anymore...$s#$b#It feels like you don't appreciate all the things I did—Everything I still do, for you, @.$s",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Bad.5": "You don't look at me anymore.$s#$b#What are you trying not to see, @?$s",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Bad.6": "I love you so, so much, why don't you seem to understand, @?$s#$b#I need you, I need you more than I need air itself.$s#$b#Why won't you talk to me?$a#$b#Please, @. I'm going insane without you. No one loves you more than me.$a#$b#Please, at least a whisper, a singular word...$a",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Bad.7": "...$s#$b#Oh, Are you finally talking to me?$s#$b#I didn't know we were doing that now...$a",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Bad.8": "%Harvey is currently ignoring you. Maybe you should talk to him more often.",
    "AfterDark.Marriage.Harvey.Bad.9": "Please, please, @.$s#$b#What do I have to do for you to love me again?$s#$b#I miss your touch, your voice, your laugh.$s#$b#You consume me, body and soul, I can't let this little dry spell we're under ruin a perfectly good marriage.$a#$b#Here, Maybe this will change your mind about me... [74]",

