    // Luau 
    /*
    As a doctor, the idea of a communal soup really disgusts me, but it's hard to deny local traditions.
    Did you put anything in? 

    The UV index today is quite high... Hm... Have you put on sunblock yet?
    Sorry, I know I'm off the clock, but as your doctor, I can't help but wish to see you in perfect health. 

    Ugh, I can't help but dread the possibility of food poisoning coming from the soup.
    I don't think I'll ever forget the year Sam thought it'd be a fun idea to throw a whole can of expired sardines into the batch.
    My office was swarming with people for days afterwards.

    --- 

    ...(Shock)
    Damn, I guess the sun isn't the only scorching hot thing around here.
    Sorry... Was that too cheesy?

    Oh, petname. Do be wary of eating the soup--I believe they accidentally put something you're allergic to in there.
    -> I'm not allergic to anything...
        Oh, how cute that you believe that. Don't eat the soup, @.
    -> Oh, how tragic...
        I know how much you were looking forward to it, but I'd rather you not go into shock, @. I can't have my (husband/wife/spouse) getting sick like that again...

    Did you want to move somewhere with more shade, petname?
    Though you look absolutely radiant, I'd rather you not get heat stroke. 
    */
