    // Desert Festival
    /*
    ...
    Do be careful out here, @. Those mines are a lot worse than the ones at home.
    ...As your doctor, I do hope you'll take my worse of caution to heart. I'd rather you not get sicker than you already are. 

    Though the sun's beating down, it's such a perfect day for these festivities.
    Although, as much as I love seeing you flushed from the heat, you really should wear some sunscreen, @. 
    Doctor's orders! And make sure you reapply every few hours, yeah?

    Oh... I love coming out here to collect some medicinal herbs I can't quite find back in Pelican Town, but...
    Ugh, do tell me if you come across any aloe plants while you're running around, yeah?
    They're quite helpful for wound treatment in a pinch... 
    
    ---

    Make sure you stay hydrated out here, yeah?
    Though I'd love nothing more than to nurse you back to health, I don't need you passing out in front of all these people.

    Do you really have to go into the mines, petname?
    Why don't you stay here and help me out with a few things. I'm sure I have a spare nurse outfit somewhere. 

    Fancy seeing you here, petname.
    Did something happen? Did you hurt yourself?
    Oh... You just wanted to talk--Oh, well, have I ever told you all about the natural remedies found in the desert?
